      {
        "fields": {
          "options": [
            "Three: Plan, Code, QA",
            "Two: Plan and Code",
            "Keep all five"
          ],
          "question": "How many review checks should the default conductor run?",
          "statement": "The default conductor runs three review checks: Plan (model and compliance), Code (quality) and QA (the built binary does what the leaf says); the scope check is dropped; a critic runs only on a check with a blocker or major finding.",
